        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: George Roby Dempster, Cas Walker, Guy Smith Jr.\n- Places: Knoxville, Tennessee\n- Roles: city manager, mayor, businessman, politician, editor, television personality, radio personality\n- Organizations: Knoxville Journal\n- Topics: political battles\n\nFacts:\n- Orton Caswell \"Cas\" Walker was born on March 23, 1902, and was a Tennessee businessman, politician, and television and radio personality.\n- George Roby Dempster served as city manager and mayor of Knoxville.\n- In Knoxville, George Roby Dempster became legendary for political battles with businessman Cas Walker and Knoxville Journal editor Guy Smith Jr.\n- Cas Walker died on September 25, 1998.",
